    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="a1baee2b-b6a4-5121-9413-e41ccdb11fb2" activityNameId="604c7f67-2646-5ce3-a347-90956ae7d2dd" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, at production onshore</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, at production onshore
The onshore oil production delivers the product natural gas. The values are derived from a multioutput-process "combined onshore gas and oil production" by allocation based on heating values for crude oil and natural gas UUID=cceca01f-dbce-309c-8a34-d1941b106792
Production of natural gas including energy use, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: Data valid for TH.
Technology: 80 % offshore and  20 % onshore production
Time period: Time of most relevant publications and statistics. Other generic data, e.g. for infrastructure are based on older publications.
Production volume: 5 billion Nm3 natural gas per year in 2023.
Sampling: Statistics and use of generic data
Extrapolations: A part of the data has been estimated with generic assumptions for onshore production.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cceca01f-dbce-309c-8a34-d1941b106792.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="061c7124-58e9-52cc-91dc-64a14555450e" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
